 <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">415</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">31</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">“永寂之赫勒尔”经过超限改造后的形态，天命结合其作战数据做出的改良，让它绽放出了更耀眼的光辉。当它出现的一瞬间，周围的声音皆沉寂下来，仅有宛如深海传来的不眠悲鸣在耳边回响······</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">\t\t\t\t幽溟之裁</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]发动一次突刺攻击，造成50%攻击力物理伤害。如果击中非无敌/霸体状态的敌人，则发动投技攻击，控制敌人并造成共90%+1400.0%攻击力物理伤害；在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%+800.0%攻击力物理伤害，不计入冷却时间；投技攻击可以触发一次能量喷涌，对被投技控制的敌人造成100%攻击力的物理伤害。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">\t\t\t湮世怒涛</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">蓄力攻击和投技攻击的暴击伤害提高30.0%。爆发状态下，投技攻击和能量喷涌额外附加400.0%攻击力的物理伤害，且每2.5秒释放一次冲击，造成60.0%攻击力的物理伤害，该攻击的类型视为必杀技，有50%的额外暴击率</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">寂没洪流</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色的暴击率提高25.0%。投技攻击引发的能量喷涌结束后，增加一层充能，每层充能使下次投技攻击回复自身3.50点能量，且投技攻击和能量喷涌的暴击率提高4.0%，每增加两层充能，能量喷涌次数增加一次，最多叠加8层，持续到本场战斗结束。满层时，每次能量喷涌额外附加300%攻击力的物理伤害</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/227/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/14/50494840/57e18d879b158e87691114122c55d34c_8071391916080288106.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「永寂之赫勒尔」图鉴后任意骑枪蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A9%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2255%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%