A%A8%E7%95%99%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BB%E7%81%B5%E6%96%A9%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E6%89%93%E6%96%AD%E5%A6%82%E5%9C%B0%E8%97%8F%E5%BE%A1%E9%AD%82%E7%AD%89BOSS%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22img%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fuploadstatic.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2021%2F11%2F02%2F50494840%2F4961ef86541990be9d0a6ae0b00cdde4_7753316965586388515.gif%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1667833326199\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/11/02/73514954/d96a17d8d20b1ac8a547ae52396d9fdc_5610551887211293603.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>辉骑士 · 月魄</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">月魄的毕业武器之一，适用于往世乐土的玩法。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/c8935048fddffe315c844aad2451251b_1112418460052104805.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>明日福音</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提高面板以及输出能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/11/02/50494840/4961ef86541990be9d0a6ae0b00cdde4_7753316965586388515.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动提高角色暴击率、爆伤和能量回复。主动技能在能量喷涌满层(8层)后的增幅相当可观；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">往世乐土中搭配辉骑士 · 月魄的专属刻印可加速叠层；而在其他玩法中介于释放动作优秀、后摇小，同时强化幻灵斩需要等待极限闪避的CD，所以一般来说武器主动留在开大后两次强化幻灵斩期间使用，或者用来打断如地藏御魂等BOSS的技能。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/11/02/50494840/4961ef86541990be9d0a6ae0b00cdde4_7753316965586388515.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
